    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc10 Goat Mode: Activated</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A hilarious, challenging, and seriously addictive platformer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready to become THE goat? Enter the arena. Jump, fail, repeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Goat Mode: Activated, each level is a challenge. Complete it, and replay it with additional maluses: slippery surfaces, additional traps, reduced visibility... Choose your torments and create an increasingly impossible experience. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think you\u2019re ready for completing the highest challenge?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u26a0\ufe0f This game doesn\u2019t want you to succeed</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Merciless platforms and tight gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maluses that get harder and stack up like a puzzle, challenging your skill and patience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Awesome characters to unlock based on your difficulty progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chill but absurd atmosphere to make the pain easier to swallow</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A game coded in few <span class=\"bb_strike\">years</span> <span class=\"bb_strike\">months</span> days, but one that could make you rage for eternity</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfaf For whom?</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fans of Celeste, I Wanna Be The Guy, or any game that shows no mercy</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Those who love voluntary suffering</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Caprinae lovers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For anyone who feels bad enough for me to give this mess a chance</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcf0 Review Highlights*</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >God is a Goat \u2013 90/100</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201c<i>A true masterpiece in its originality. Imagine if\u00a0Hades and Celeste had a baby \u2014 you'd get Goat Mode: Activated.</i>\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sheep Happens \u2013 95/100</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201c<i>Every jump feels like a leap of faith. One moment you're flying, the next, you're baa-dly falling.</i>\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meeh-tacritic \u2013 95/100</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201c<i>A must-play for platformer enthusiasts looking for a challenge. Prepare to rage, then love it.</i>\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Polygoat \u2013 10/10</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201c<i>The game is a technical mess, poorly optimized, with graphics straight out of the 90s... but I'm completely hooked and won't quit until I became THE goat !</i>\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* All review quotes above are fictional and just for fun!</p>",
