ragraph\" >\u201c<i>A true masterpiece in its originality. Imagine if\u00a0Hades and Celeste had a baby \u2014 you'd get Goat Mode: Activated.</i>\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sheep Happens \u2013 95/100</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201c<i>Every jump feels like a leap of faith. One moment you're flying, the next, you're baa-dly falling.</i>\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meeh-tacritic \u2013 95/100</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201c<i>A must-play for platformer enthusiasts looking for a challenge. Prepare to rage, then love it.</i>\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Polygoat \u2013 10/10</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201c<i>The game is a technical mess, poorly optimized, with graphics straight out of the 90s... but I'm completely hooked and won't quit until I became THE goat !</i>\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* All review quotes above are fictional and just for fun!</p>",
